#: Includes/LknIntegrationRedeForWoocommerce.php:954
msgid "Rede's authentication protocol will be changed to OAuth 2.0 on 01/05/2026. All customers using e.Rede must update the plugin. This measure will contribute to security and help prevent targeted attacks on your transactions. After the deadline, transactions can only be performed using the updated plugin."
